Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:39.40,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Laala! Fuwari! Do-Re-Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:41.24,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.50,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Summer's here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.03,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Let's go on an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:00.76,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,There's a heap of things we want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:03.59,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,That we want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:09.47,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,We get a treasure map in the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:15.10,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,And we suddenly come across a giant watermelon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:19.27,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Our hearts beat like crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.94,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,At the familiar striped pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:25.03,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Dead or alive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:27.89,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,What's happening up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.12,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.74,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Let's dive right in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.37,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,It's an unforgettable summer adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:36.38,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone! We're all stocked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:39.17,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Let's make use of this happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:42.01,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Raise our arms, and push up toward the blue sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.55,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,It's a surprising summer adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.22,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Isn't it an awesome view?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:47.55,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:50.47,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,This was well worth the thrill
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:53.35,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,Go for it!! Hey! Hey! Let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.10,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you all will
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.08,0:14:59.02,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}You all will stand above the rest, always and forever!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.14,0:15:02.94,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}It's an unforgettable summer adventure!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.94,0:15:05.90,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}All right, everyone! Let's get fired up!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.94,0:15:08.78,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Don't leave! Don't give up!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.78,0:15:11.62,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Flap your wings! Let it all out!!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.17,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}It's an unrestrained summer adventure
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.28,0:15:17.17,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Even the wind is with us
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.09,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Let's go wild! Let's go even further!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.09,0:15:22.94,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Go for it!! Hey! Hey! Let's dance!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.94,0:15:25.72,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Higher, higher, and even further up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.72,0:15:28.51,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Until you've reached the place you've been aiming for
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.51,0:15:32.06,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Ring the bell as a signal
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.06,0:15:37.10,Insert56-01-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Ding dong! Ding dong! Go Go!
