Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,105, 106, 107...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Toriko has had a life full of misfortune-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt like things changed when she met Fuwari, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because this morning, Fuwari is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Midorikaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I've only known you all for a short while,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you've helped me in so many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'll be heading back to the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Genius? What's That-panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading back to the Palps?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What brought this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up becoming a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I'm no longer a princess scholarship student.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm pretty sure that Hibiki won't let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true you may have originally come here \Nas a princess scholarship student,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but are you sure you really \Nwant to leave the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She's absolutely right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, why not attend school \Nas a regular student like the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be like a school of fish attending school together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} want to do, Fuwari?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The goats want to know, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you really feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara truly is a lot of fun and I really enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I became good friends with Toriko and all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I really would like to stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've become such good friends,\N I don't want to say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Hibiki won't forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hibiki won't see you without an appointment.
Comment: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:22.27,Default2,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something you can do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Max Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk to Lord Shikyouin about something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand you let us pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.38,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HCE5139&}Please let us see him! Please let us see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a regular person!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please...
Comment: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting Headmaster{Acting Principal}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Andou...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let Fuwari continue attending school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether she'll be staying or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the one who decided that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I really would like to continue if you'd let me stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.73,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't you already make your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it bad to be so indecisive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may have a word, Acting Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're familiar with Paprika Private Academy school rule, number 157:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't worry about it at night, \Nworry about it in the morning", correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All humans make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.35,0:05:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think the best at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Midorikaze thought it over\N and decided she would like to stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe her desire should be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's a rule my grandfather made,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll respect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Fuwari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An approval capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H19198B&}Isn't that great, goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Another case closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's Houjou Sophy and Toudou Sion...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is he staring so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he planning to get in our way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll take them!
Comment: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For... For you to be forced to live in the attic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This room is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so close to the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity that you decided to give up\N the princess candidacy, Miss Midorikaze,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but your manner lessons won't stop \Njust because you're a normal student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that, yet you're barefoot!
Comment: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they've brought their favourite bed.
Comment: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're crazy strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But that'll never fit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, school rule number 82:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Moving school furniture is prohibited"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your first insubordination ticket! {check with Naisho's season 1 subs for consistency with phrasing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just give you a present to replace it with!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A futon of grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.59,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that, Fuwari?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rina, let's clean up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.47,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.62,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Move complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moved to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move-in pizza from Papa's Pasta has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you won the Summer Dream, you'll be having\N your début concert as Dressing Flower tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please eat this and put on a good show tomorrow, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:32.94,Default2,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuwari, you're not leaving after all-tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I worried you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really not-tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tori! Tori! Tori! Tori! T—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a dream-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Toriko isn't used to being happy,\N but now she's insanely happy-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for tomorrow-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Comment: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The delicious hamburger place closed down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a message from the gods,\N telling you to only eat meat buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes Mikan a little sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Man! I overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm super sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuwari just went in Prism Stone with everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to miss today's show, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, give us a good show again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number\N of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Another performance in the coord that \Ngreatly contributed to your winning the SummDrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise Summer Adventure Coord!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they've got in their numerous pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe their dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect Summer Adventure Coord!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,While searching for that answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,they start their friendship-filled performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgettable Summer Adventure Coord!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The debut concert for our Summer Dream\N winners is now starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls chosen this time have opened a path\N to perform in next year's parade with this coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be the five girls chosen\N to ring the Bell of Miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't want to miss seeing such wonderful ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll want to completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...let it soak and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...absorb into your heart.
Comment: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.36,Default2,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's call them out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us get this underway. \NNow introducing Dressing Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressing Flower is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Dressing Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a full house!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for joining us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're awesome, aren't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the best in PriPara now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna see show like ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, please listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Unforgettable Summer Adventure"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream Theatre Show, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Cyalume Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Cyalume Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yodeleihi!{she's yodeling}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Let's ring the bell of everyone's dreams!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's dreams have become one!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Echo! Charm Bell!{consistency 56}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.97,Default2,,0,0,0,,Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a thunderous applause for Dressing Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep your eyes on these five in our upcoming Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our coords changed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Summer Dream Parade Coord vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The wings which soar through the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When they are spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a sole Lilium Casa Blanca shall bloom in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight is the first act of Masquerade Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...Phantom Thief Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Phantom Thief Genius-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give our coords back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of attraction-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is no attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a guy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}A guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}A guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:16:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back, you perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why such aggression?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.87,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This coord is not for those \Nwho are undeserving to wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Undeserving?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who-panda? Who-panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But we got it by winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely false!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing Dream Tickets, among other things, \Nis strictly prohibited here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stand-off between two pretty boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That means this has to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a complete narcissist, aren't you? {Normally I wouldn't keep "narcissist" since it's unlikely it's being used correctly and is a loan word, buuuut given the implications with Hibiki as a whole, I feel it should be left just in case we're going hint hint wink wink nudge nudge here}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,While that may be true...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming there are times \Nwhen you are just {\i1}too{\i0} perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural to love oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a point-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Those girls won those fair and square-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You dirty thief{bastard}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.82,Default2,,0,0,0,,That's right-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you so important-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.78,Default2,,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Panda! Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all friends?{consistency with... 56?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That way of thinking here in PriPara ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Heed this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, PriPara will no longer be \Nfor playing at being friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but for measuring raw ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends will fall to the wayside,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and instead you'll be facing off as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:18:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to get away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A card?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's escaping-panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Area B2, clear-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in B2-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in A5-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go-panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not let him get too far-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:23.01,Default2,,0,0,0,,No reports of where he has gone-panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He vanished?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the coords?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they've been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean we \Nwon't be able to be in the parade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Over this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...stylish...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...guy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...dead body will I let him get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we made a mistake\N and let him slip by this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has he come to PriPara despite being a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is his goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait for us as we\N thoroughly investigate this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like that guy will show up again \Nat the next Grand Prix-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time, I'll steal your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Autumn is just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that by the time the Autumn Dream \NIdol GrandPrix arrives, this will have been solved...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,by Meganii.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving it to someone else, huh-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're all friends?{consistency with... 56?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're all idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to wait until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure that we all stay friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll make sure that \NPhantom Thief Whatever It Was understands that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Genius-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I would also like to have \NMr. Phantom Thief understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him get away with saying \Nwe're just playing at being friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1666.5,1030.5)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(976.5,1030.5)}Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,1030.5)}Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we happen to find \Nthe mysterious thief somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:20:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that'll be the end of the line for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure to capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Meganii!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal these away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.01,0:23:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3}I decided to visit since\N I'm on summer break!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see all of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so looking forward to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.54,0:23:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing well, Unicorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're not the only ones who came back-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Who else came?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to wait and find out-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Falulu Has Returned-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dechu!{"Ditch!" -Pik}
